31,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Good morning, everyone. Now that the first night has passed, it's time to see if anyone has information to share. Does the Seer wish to speak?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I'm afraid I don't have any special information to share, dear. I'm just a simple villager hoping we can all stay safe.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be watching closely. If the Seer is among us, they might be waiting for the right moment to reveal themselves to avoid being targeted.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I believe it is time to be transparent. I am the Seer, and my divination last night revealed that Shizue is the Werewolf.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Whoa, really?! Shizue? I can't believe it! She seems so nice, but I guess that's how the werewolf tricks us, right?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minako,,"That is a very bold claim, Benjamin. Shizue, how do you respond to this accusation? It's a serious charge that could lead to your execution today.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, my goodness... I am truly heartbroken that Benjamin would say such a thing. I promise you all, I am just a humble villager. I don't know why he would lie about me.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"The contrast between Shizue's gentle demeanor and Benjamin's direct accusation is stark. However, the Seer's role is to provide facts, not judgments based on personality. Benjamin, do you have any reason to doubt your own result?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"None whatsoever. The divination was clear and unambiguous. While Shizue's kindness is a convincing mask, the logic of the role is absolute: she is the Werewolf.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I mean, Benjamin is usually so smart and calm, so he probably isn't lying, right? I'm really sad if it's Shizue, but we have to trust the Seer!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minako,,"If we trust Benjamin's claim, the decision is simple. However, we must consider if he is a Werewolf attempting to eliminate a villager early. Shizue, is there anything you can say to prove your innocence?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I truly wish I could, dear Minako, but as a simple villager, I have no special powers to prove my heart is pure. I can only ask you to trust my words.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Trusting words alone is a dangerous game in this village. However, if Benjamin is lying, he has put himself in a very precarious position by claiming the Seer role so early.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. A Werewolf claiming Seer on day one is a high-risk strategy that invites immediate scrutiny. It is far more logical for the actual Seer to reveal a confirmed threat immediately to ensure the village's survival.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm getting really confused, but Benjamin's logic sounds right! If he's the Seer, we can't just ignore him, or the werewolf will keep attacking us every night!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minako,,"It seems the consensus is leaning toward Benjamin's claim. Unless anyone else wishes to claim the Seer role right now, I believe we have enough information to proceed to the vote.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"If it is for the peace of the village, I will accept whatever you decide, though it pains me that you would believe such a lie about me.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I have no reason to doubt Benjamin's logic or the risk he's taking. Shizue's reaction is gentle, but that doesn't provide evidence of innocence. I'm inclined to vote for Shizue.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The evidence is clear, and the risk of keeping a confirmed Werewolf among us far outweighs the risk of my claim being false. I urge you all to vote for Shizue.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'll vote for Shizue too! It's really hard because she's so sweet, but we have to trust Benjamin if we want to win this!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
